/*
contributors: Patricio Gonzalez Vivo
description: |
    round a value to the nearest integer. Metal already provides a native round() for
    float and every float vector type (halfway cases round away from zero, like the GLSL
    version), so redefining it here would make every call ambiguous. Use the native function.
use: <float|float2|float3|float4> round(<float|float2|float3|float4> value)
